From: buntOS contributors
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mediatek: build Lenovo TB375FC and TB373FU device trees

Add the MediaTek MT6897 (Dimensity 8300) tablets Lenovo Xiaoxin Pad Pro 12.7
(2025, TB375FC) and Lenovo Idea Tab Pro (TB373FU) to the MediaTek dtb list.
buntOS kernel/tb375fc/build.sh copies the device tree sources into the tree.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/Makefile
@@ -6,6 +6,8 @@
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6795-sony-xperia-m5.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6797-evb.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6797-x20-dev.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6897-lenovo-tb373fu.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt6897-lenovo-tb375fc.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt7622-rfb1.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt7622-bananapi-bpi-r64.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MEDIATEK) += mt7981b-cudy-wr3000-v1.dtb
